OL,3,CTeenager dies in car crash near college
OL,5,FA 17 year old boy involved in a car
OL,6,Fcrash in West Berkshire has died.
OL,8,FThe incident happened close to
OL,9,FBradfield College, near the A340, on
OL,10,FWednesday morning, according to Thames
OL,11,FValley Police.
OL,13,FThe boy, who was driving a red
OL,14,FVolkswagen Lupo, was pronounced dead
OL,15,Fat the scene.
OL,17,FNo other vehicle was involved.
